+// Deterministic evidence harness for the formation-barrier-release-
+// snapshot-coherence quest: receipt declarations only. The shared runtime
+// (scripts/quest-evidence-harness-runtime.js) re-runs each recorded proof
+// command and writes the probe artifact.
